README file for directory /usr/share/fonts/truetype/hobart
created 1/12/201 Frank Albers

This directory is the standard configuration directory for HLX/Access system fonts.
Since the print renderer expects the font file names to be lowercase the following files were renamed to all lowercase:
abalone.ttf
centurion.ttf
everest..ttf
gravilex.ttf
hauteclaire.ttf
hobart.ttf
hobartbold.ttf
hobartplain.ttf
london.ttf
marquee12.ttf
patrician.ttf
quantum.ttf
sp.ttf
splarge.ttf
tancred.ttf
ultima.ttf

Any other fonts that are added for the HLX/Access printers must have all lowercase filenames and be in both of the following directories:
/usr/local/hobart/system/fonts/ or /usr/local/hobart/user/fonts/
/usr/share/fonts/truetype/hobart/


